00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:35.020
Let's go, everyone!

00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:37.440
Together with the sunshine!

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:40.690
Sunny Peace!

00:02:13.810 --> 00:02:16.810
Has the word arrived yet?

00:02:16.810 --> 00:02:19.560
That was your fifth time asking that.

00:02:19.560 --> 00:02:22.270
You're very calm, Rei.

00:02:22.270 --> 00:02:24.850
I'm actually nervous, too.

00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:26.690
I've got it this time.

00:02:26.690 --> 00:02:27.810
This time, I'm part of a group,

00:02:27.810 --> 00:02:31.350
and I have improved skill-wise, too.

00:02:31.350 --> 00:02:35.690
It's been three months since the Next Venus
Grand Prix preliminaries started, huh?

00:02:35.690 --> 00:02:37.400
That went by fast, don't you think?

00:02:37.400 --> 00:02:40.190
We've accumulated lots of points...

00:02:40.190 --> 00:02:41.350
I'm pretty sure.

00:02:41.350 --> 00:02:44.440
How many groups get to be in the finals again?

00:02:44.440 --> 00:02:45.770
Sixteen groups.

00:02:45.770 --> 00:02:48.850
I wonder if all of us will make it...

00:02:48.850 --> 00:02:51.150
Until the results are announced,

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:52.440
we won't know.

00:02:54.810 --> 00:02:56.560
We've received word from management.

00:02:56.560 --> 00:02:57.400
What are the results?!

00:02:57.400 --> 00:02:58.560
Did we make it to the finals?!

00:02:58.560 --> 00:03:00.230
--Which group?
--Both groups?!

00:03:00.230 --> 00:03:03.310
Calm down! Get back, get back.

00:03:08.650 --> 00:03:12.230
Sunny Peace, Moon Tempest...

00:03:12.230 --> 00:03:14.440
Both groups will be moving on to the finals!

00:03:15.480 --> 00:03:17.060
Heck yeah!

00:03:17.060 --> 00:03:18.270
What?!

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:20.630
President's Office

00:03:22.590 --> 00:03:24.600
Moon Tempest

00:03:22.590 --> 00:03:24.600
Sunny Peace

00:03:25.310 --> 00:03:27.190
They barely made it.

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:31.480
"16 Finalists Selected"

00:03:38.100 --> 00:03:40.270
The finals three years ago...

00:03:40.270 --> 00:03:43.900
Time stopped for us right before it happened.

00:03:43.900 --> 00:03:46.310
We've been waiting for this Grand Prix.

00:03:46.310 --> 00:03:49.850
We'll be the ones who'll rise to the top.

00:03:49.850 --> 00:03:51.850
Thank you very much.

00:03:51.850 --> 00:03:56.060
TRINITYAiLE, we would like
to hear your thoughts, too.

00:03:56.060 --> 00:03:57.350
Yes.

00:03:57.350 --> 00:04:02.100
We came in second,
behind our seniors in the preliminaries.

00:04:02.100 --> 00:04:05.520
But we'll be the ones who'll win.

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:08.770
Are you declaring your victory over us?

00:04:08.770 --> 00:04:10.980
I wouldn't mind if you took it that way.

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:12.690
Let's both do our best!

00:04:12.690 --> 00:04:17.560
We're your dear juniors,
so please don't be too hard on us.

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:20.270
We'll know the results when we get on stage.

00:04:20.270 --> 00:04:22.350
I'm looking forward to it.

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:28.770
Mr. Makino.

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:32.150
I have a favor to ask you.

00:04:32.150 --> 00:04:36.020
Will you please come with me
to my next regular check-up?

00:04:36.020 --> 00:04:37.560
Regular check-up?

00:04:37.560 --> 00:04:38.440
Yes.

00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:41.020
Since there were continuous concert
battles in the preliminaries,

00:04:41.020 --> 00:04:44.230
before the finals start,
my doctor wants to confirm with you

00:04:44.230 --> 00:04:47.100
how much exercise I've been getting.

00:04:47.100 --> 00:04:49.480
I see.

00:04:49.480 --> 00:04:50.440
Sure thing.

00:04:50.440 --> 00:04:53.600
It's better to be on top
of these things. When is it?

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:55.900
Makino, Makino!

00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:57.230
LizNoir...

00:04:57.230 --> 00:04:59.350
Miss Kanzaki is here.

00:04:59.350 --> 00:05:04.520
A lot of idols train at this studio, so it
wouldn't be a surprise to see them here.

00:05:04.520 --> 00:05:06.900
It's not like that...

00:05:06.900 --> 00:05:09.480
Congratulations on making it to the finals.

00:05:09.480 --> 00:05:13.020
You were practically novices just
the other day, so you should be proud.

00:05:13.020 --> 00:05:16.600
How great, right Suzu- <i>nyan</i> ?
We got complimented!

00:05:16.600 --> 00:05:18.270
Well, of course we did!

00:05:19.270 --> 00:05:21.940
Your coaching us that time got us here.

00:05:21.940 --> 00:05:24.650
Thank you very much for that.

00:05:24.650 --> 00:05:26.770
Moon Tempest.

00:05:26.770 --> 00:05:28.100
It's a good group.

00:05:28.100 --> 00:05:30.150
Very well-balanced.

00:05:30.150 --> 00:05:33.850
You definitely have the potential
Mr. Saegusa recognized in you.

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:34.810
But...

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:36.190
Kotono Nagase.

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:40.520
You just look like Mana Nagase.

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:46.850
I watched her ever since
she made her debut.

00:05:46.850 --> 00:05:48.270
More than anyone else.

00:05:48.270 --> 00:05:50.730
So I can tell you this bluntly...

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:53.980
Right now, you're merely an inferior copy.

00:05:57.060 --> 00:05:59.980
What do you know about Kotono?

00:05:59.980 --> 00:06:01.560
Nagisa?

00:06:01.560 --> 00:06:06.480
Do you even know what it's like
for her being an idol?

00:06:06.480 --> 00:06:08.440
Thanks, Nagisa.

00:06:08.440 --> 00:06:09.900
But I'm okay.

00:06:09.900 --> 00:06:11.850
Kotono...

00:06:11.850 --> 00:06:15.270
I'm pretty sure that Miss Kanzaki
and I are the same.

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:19.520
You watched only my sister for a long time...

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:21.690
Isn't that right?

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:23.940
Don't put words in my mouth.

00:06:25.730 --> 00:06:26.850
Everyone!

00:06:26.850 --> 00:06:29.150
Hurry up and get to the studio.

00:06:29.150 --> 00:06:30.850
Mr. Makino.

00:06:30.850 --> 00:06:33.190
Rio, what are you doing?

00:06:33.190 --> 00:06:35.350
We're done talking now.

00:06:35.350 --> 00:06:37.270
Let's get practicing already.

00:06:37.270 --> 00:06:38.480
Hello.

00:06:38.480 --> 00:06:41.440
I heard that you took care
of our girls that one time.

00:06:41.440 --> 00:06:44.400
Oh, no. It was my pleasure.

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:47.270
I'd like to thank you, too, for the lesson.

00:06:47.270 --> 00:06:49.060
That's why we're here now.

00:06:49.060 --> 00:06:51.600
Makino, who is this person?

00:06:51.600 --> 00:06:54.310
Dummy! She's LizNoir's producer.

00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:55.600
What?!

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:58.850
As we both advance,
we'll eventually face each other.

00:06:58.850 --> 00:07:01.310
I'm looking forward
to when that time comes.

00:07:01.310 --> 00:07:02.850
Yes!

00:07:02.850 --> 00:07:05.350
As long as you're Mana Nagase's sister,

00:07:05.350 --> 00:07:07.770
you won't be able to move up any further.

00:07:09.560 --> 00:07:10.730
Are you okay?

00:07:10.730 --> 00:07:11.810
Yes.

00:07:11.810 --> 00:07:12.980
Thank you very much.

00:07:28.480 --> 00:07:29.900
Miss Kawasaki.

00:07:29.900 --> 00:07:31.560
Miss Sakura Kawasaki.

00:07:31.560 --> 00:07:32.560
Yes!

00:07:33.940 --> 00:07:38.190
You'll probably be called in by
the doctor after the tests are done.

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:39.020
Got it.

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:41.020
Thank you, I'll see you later!

00:07:45.600 --> 00:07:48.150
These check-ups take a long time, huh?

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:50.520
I really feel for Sakura.

00:07:50.520 --> 00:07:52.230
You show concern for Sakura,

00:07:52.230 --> 00:07:54.850
but you're cold when it comes to Kotono.

00:07:54.850 --> 00:07:56.100
You think so?

00:07:56.100 --> 00:08:00.100
You haven't mentioned anything about the
interaction between Kotono and Miss Kanzaki.

00:08:00.100 --> 00:08:03.020
Are you not concerned for your sister?

00:08:03.020 --> 00:08:05.480
There's no point in being concerned.

00:08:05.480 --> 00:08:08.400
There's nothing I can do anyway.

00:08:11.270 --> 00:08:13.560
Are you Miss Sakura Kawasaki's guardian?

00:08:13.560 --> 00:08:14.900
Yes.

00:08:14.900 --> 00:08:17.350
Please go to examining room three.

00:08:20.440 --> 00:08:24.020
Mana, will you stay outside?

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:25.520
Why?

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:27.940
This is Sakura's private matter.

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:29.810
Really?

00:08:29.810 --> 00:08:32.060
Well, that's fine by me.

00:08:32.060 --> 00:08:33.520
Thanks.

00:08:36.690 --> 00:08:40.230
Well, it'd be a lie if I said
there's nothing to worry about.

00:08:40.230 --> 00:08:42.940
But there's no problem for the time being.

00:08:42.940 --> 00:08:44.310
Really?

00:08:44.310 --> 00:08:46.900
Quite some time has passed
since the transplant.

00:08:46.900 --> 00:08:51.270
And it seems that she's gradually
worked up to her current level of exercise.

00:08:51.270 --> 00:08:52.650
That's a relief.

00:08:52.650 --> 00:08:57.060
I was surprised when I heard
she was going to become an idol.

00:08:57.060 --> 00:08:58.350
Um...

00:08:58.350 --> 00:09:00.980
Regarding Sakura's heart...

00:09:00.980 --> 00:09:02.310
Yes?

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:05.600
What kind of person was the donor?

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:10.690
As a matter of principle, information
regarding the donor is confidential.

00:09:10.690 --> 00:09:12.270
I see.

00:09:12.270 --> 00:09:15.940
There was something I was curious about.

00:09:15.940 --> 00:09:17.650
What is it?

00:09:17.650 --> 00:09:21.480
Our agency is called Hoshimi Productions.

00:09:21.480 --> 00:09:25.600
And we lost an idol
to an accident three years ago.

00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:28.100
Her name was Mana Nagase.

00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:31.400
Sakura's voice sounds exactly like hers.

00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:35.100
I had a hunch there could be a connection.

00:09:35.100 --> 00:09:38.770
What a strange coincidence.

00:09:38.770 --> 00:09:39.770
Yes.

00:09:39.770 --> 00:09:45.060
When I met Sakura,
it felt like Mana guided her to us.

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:47.190
That's all.

00:09:47.190 --> 00:09:48.980
I see.

00:09:54.980 --> 00:09:58.060
Mr. Makino, is the meeting over?

00:09:58.060 --> 00:10:00.230
He says there are no concerns worth noting.

00:10:00.230 --> 00:10:02.440
That's great. What a relief.

00:10:02.440 --> 00:10:05.900
Now Sakura can focus all her energy
on the Grand Prix.

00:10:08.350 --> 00:10:09.560
What is it?

00:10:09.560 --> 00:10:10.650
Huh?

00:10:11.810 --> 00:10:13.270
Mr. Makino?

00:10:13.270 --> 00:10:15.940
Oh, sorry.

00:10:15.940 --> 00:10:17.230
It's nothing.

00:10:19.400 --> 00:10:20.900
<i>Idoly Pride</i> .

00:10:22.270 --> 00:10:26.020
Celebrating Moonest and Sunny P
making it to the finals!

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:29.650
Cheers!

00:10:29.650 --> 00:10:31.520
--Nom, nom, nom!
--This is delicious.

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:32.440
Really? Give me a bite!

00:10:32.440 --> 00:10:34.690
--Make sure you eat a well-balanced meal.
--Okay!

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:37.310
Miss Haruko, are you drinking wine?

00:10:37.310 --> 00:10:38.770
That's right.

00:10:38.770 --> 00:10:41.850
You gotta have a drink to celebrate...

00:10:41.850 --> 00:10:44.940
Miss Haruko, we still have practice
tomorrow, so please take it easy--

00:10:44.940 --> 00:10:49.900
I said, call me Haruko! Gosh...

00:10:49.900 --> 00:10:51.650
Suzu, you're not eating?

00:10:51.650 --> 00:10:52.900
O-Oh...

00:10:52.900 --> 00:10:54.350
No, um...

00:10:54.350 --> 00:10:58.270
We usually... split the cost, don't we?

00:10:58.270 --> 00:11:00.690
The thing is... I... Well...

00:11:00.690 --> 00:11:03.020
You used up your salary again?

00:11:03.020 --> 00:11:04.770
I can't help it!

00:11:04.770 --> 00:11:09.810
Mother canceled the credit card because
I became an idol without her consent!

00:11:09.810 --> 00:11:15.730
Suzu, you need to learn how
to manage your money.

00:11:15.730 --> 00:11:17.980
But there's no need to worry today!

00:11:17.980 --> 00:11:20.230
This is all Mr. Makino's treat!

00:11:20.230 --> 00:11:21.350
Really?!

00:11:21.350 --> 00:11:23.850
It's a reward for making it to the finals.

00:11:23.850 --> 00:11:25.770
I'll treat you to <i>yakiniku</i>
for the next victory.

00:11:25.770 --> 00:11:29.350
All right! Generous manager!

00:11:29.350 --> 00:11:31.980
Mr... Makino!

00:11:31.980 --> 00:11:33.770
Mr. Makino?

00:11:33.770 --> 00:11:36.810
Oh my goodness.
I would die for <i>yakiniku</i> !

00:11:36.810 --> 00:11:39.980
I wonder what we'll get if we win?

00:11:44.150 --> 00:11:46.650
Miss Haruko, you'll catch a cold.

00:11:46.650 --> 00:11:49.270
It's Haruko!

00:11:49.270 --> 00:11:53.650
Let's wait for now and wake her up later.

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:55.850
I wonder why she didn't get popular.

00:11:55.850 --> 00:11:57.900
When she's this cute...

00:12:01.810 --> 00:12:04.230
Shizuku, what are you looking at?

00:12:04.230 --> 00:12:05.810
Egosurfing...

00:12:05.810 --> 00:12:08.650
So? How is my reputation?

00:12:08.650 --> 00:12:10.350
For Suzu...

00:12:10.350 --> 00:12:11.400
...nothing comes up.

00:12:11.400 --> 00:12:14.150
What? That is impossible!

00:12:14.150 --> 00:12:16.770
Someone wrote about Kotono!

00:12:16.770 --> 00:12:19.690
"As expected of Mana Nagase's sister,

00:12:19.690 --> 00:12:21.600
she's a great singer.

00:12:21.600 --> 00:12:25.100
Her presence reminds me of Mana, too..."!

00:12:25.100 --> 00:12:27.520
Good for you, Kotono!

00:12:27.520 --> 00:12:28.810
Yeah.

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:31.810
If you do a better job searching,
there has to be something about me...

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:34.520
"Slow Joy@joyslow
But Mana is hands-down more talented."

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:40.980
Kotono, don't let this get to you.

00:12:40.980 --> 00:12:42.690
Th-That's right!

00:12:42.690 --> 00:12:46.440
Deplorables who say
such things are everywhere.

00:12:46.440 --> 00:12:47.480
Anything else?

00:12:47.480 --> 00:12:50.060
Oh. Um...

00:12:50.060 --> 00:12:52.020
This one's about Sakura.

00:12:52.020 --> 00:12:52.980
What?

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:54.330
{=4}Don't you think Sakura Kawasaki of Sunny P

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:54.330
{=3}resembles Mana more than Kotono Nagase?

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:54.330
{=8}Support idols...

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:54.330
{=7}Her aura and how she sings

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:54.330
{=6}are exactly like her.

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:54.370
{=4}Don't you think Sakura Kawasaki of Sunny P

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:54.370
{=3}resembles Mana more than Kotono Nagase?

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:54.370
{=8}Support idols...

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:54.370
{=7}Her aura and how she sings

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:54.370
{=6}are exactly like her.

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:54.410
